 {msg}←kind Unsupported(id class names);list;what;on;at;pfx;plural;cls;stack;report
⍝ Report a ⎕WC feature EWC does not implement. kind is 'class', 'property' or 'name'.
⍝
⍝ EWC.UNSUPPORTED: 0 silent, 1 report and collect in UNSUPPORTEDLOG, 2 DOMAIN ERROR.
⍝ At 2 the result is the message and the CALLER must ⎕SIGNAL it - signalling here
⍝ would be caught by the cover's ⎕TRAP←0 'S' and suspend inside EWC.

 msg←''
 →(0=≢names←,⊆names)⍴0
 →(0=UNSUPPORTED)⍴0

 plural←1<≢names
 list←2↓∊', '∘,¨names
 cls←class,(0≠≢class)/' '

 :Select kind
 :Case 'class'
     what←'class "',(⊃names),'"'
 :Case 'property'
     what←cls,((1+plural)⊃'property' 'properties'),' ',list
 :Case 'name'
     what←(2↓∊', '∘,¨'"'∘,¨names,¨⊂'"'),' ',((1+plural)⊃'is not a' 'are not'),' ',cls,(1+plural)⊃'property' 'properties'
 :Else
     what←cls,list
 :EndSelect

 on←(0≠≢id)/' on "',id,'"'
 stack←showCallStack ⍝ Separate line: the next one reads it
 stack←(1<stack⍳¨'[')/stack ⍝ Unnamed frames come back as just "[0]"
 at←(0≠≢stack)/' at ',1↓∊' '∘,¨(2⌊≢stack)↑stack
 report←'Unsupported on eWC: ',what,on,at,'. Please write to support@dyalog.com if you want this soon.'

 :If 2=UNSUPPORTED
     →0⊣msg←report
 :EndIf

 pfx←(,'ZI2,<:>,ZI2,<.>,ZI3' ⎕FMT 1 3⍴¯3↑⎕TS),' U:'
 ⎕←pfx report
 :If 0≠≢UNSUPPORTEDLOG
     :Trap 0 ⍝ An unwritable log must not break the application
         (⊂pfx,' ',report)⎕NPUT UNSUPPORTEDLOG 2 ⍝ Catenated, not ⍕: this file gets emailed
     :Else
         'E'Log'Unable to write ',UNSUPPORTEDLOG
     :EndTrap
 :EndIf
